{"name": "HELENA : Cloud District", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the remnants of a mega-structure</strong> in search of mysterious plants. <strong>Use the camera to capture them</strong>, and bring your photographs back to the computer at the heart of this dormant world. <strong>Complete the collection</strong> and find all pictures to get a glimpse of a forgotten story.\u00a0<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/8825b19a2914bc08350ea9aa970193a2.poster.avif?t=1793300989\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/8825b19a2914bc08350ea9aa970193a2.webm?t=1793300989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/8825b19a2914bc08350ea9aa970193a2.mp4?t=1793300989\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slide, hover, and glide through the structure</strong> in your own creative way in order to reach every level and get deeper into the slumbering Cloud District. There is no single way to roam through the edifice, <strong>make your own path.</strong> <br/> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/1411cf5b597b121ca91761658876fd1a.poster.avif?t=1793300989\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/1411cf5b597b121ca91761658876fd1a.webm?t=1793300989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/1411cf5b597b121ca91761658876fd1a.mp4?t=1793300989\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore every corner of this decaying world, and <strong>bring your findings back to the sleeping computer</strong> to record them all.<br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/6acc6be212c360f27720cbf9ac7aab63.poster.avif?t=1793300989\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/6acc6be212c360f27720cbf9ac7aab63.webm?t=1793300989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/6acc6be212c360f27720cbf9ac7aab63.mp4?t=1793300989\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step back and contemplate, enjoy its <strong>atmospheric scenery and ambient soundscapes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/4b1bba61ce2c661878d440f6a1bf4173.poster.avif?t=1793300989\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/4b1bba61ce2c661878d440f6a1bf4173.webm?t=1793300989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5190580/extras/4b1bba61ce2c661878d440f6a1bf4173.mp4?t=1793300989\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p> </div>", "short_desc": "HELENA: Cloud District is an atmospheric first-person exploration game where you explore a decaying mega-structure to photograph strange plants